 are depicted as rounded rectangles, each containing a green rectangle symb=
olizing a database and a list of data stored: session data and a profile im=
age for the corresponding user.  The connections between the users and serv=
ers are shown as blue arrows indicating the direction of the HTTP requests.=
  There is no apparent interaction or data flow between the servers themsel=
ves; each operates independently to serve its assigned user." loading=3D"la=
