<p>The issue is that every request from the same client must be routed to t=
he same server. This can be done with sticky sessions in most load balancer=
s [10]; however, this adds the overhead. Adding or removing servers is much=
 more difficult with this approach. It is also challenging to handle server=
 failures.</p>
