sent web servers that publish messages. A solid dark-blue arrow labeled 'pu=
blish' connects the Producer to a central component: a dark-blue, trapezoid=
al box containing three icons resembling envelopes, representing a message =
queue labeled 'queue for photo processing'.  A second solid dark-blue arrow=
 labeled 'consume' extends from the queue to a group of three vertically st=
