 thick, upward-pointing blue arrow indicates the increase in resources.  To=
 the right, under the label 'Horizontal Scaling (Add more servers)', six li=
ght-green rectangles are arranged in two rows of three, representing multip=
le servers added to handle increased load. A thick, rightward-pointing blue=
 arrow indicates the addition of more servers. The word 'VS' is placed betw=
een the vertical and horizontal scaling representations, clearly indicating=
 a comparison.  The bottom of the diagram contains the text 'Viewer does no=
