-1-21-ZDWDWEO5.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div><div style=3D"displ=
ay: flex; justify-content: center;"><figcaption class=3D"py-1">Figure 21</f=
igcaption></div></figure>
<p>Figure 22 shows the user table in sharded databases.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a database sharding scheme.  Four cylindric=
